TEXT 80 112 Left 3 ;Strain Wave Interference Logic — LTspice Electrical Equivalent
TEXT 80 160 Left 2 ;Substrate: LiNbO3 | f0 = 10 MHz | v_SAW = 3979 m/s
TEXT 80 192 Left 2 ;Path length: 3λ = 1.19 mm → Td = 300 ns | λ/2 inverter = 150 ns
TEXT 80 240 Left 2 ;══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
TEXT 80 272 Left 2 ;TRUTH TABLE (shown sequentially in transient sim):
TEXT 80 304 Left 2 ;  t=0-1µs:  A=0 B=0  →  V(INT)~0   →  XOR=0
TEXT 80 336 Left 2 ;  t=1-3µs:  A=1 B=0  →  V(INT) full (A only)  →  XOR=1
TEXT 80 368 Left 2 ;  t=3-5µs:  A=0 B=1  →  V(INT) full (B only)  →  XOR=1
TEXT 80 400 Left 2 ;  t=5-7µs:  A=1 B=1  →  V(INT)~0 (destructive!)  →  XOR=0
TEXT 80 432 Left 2 ;  t=7-8µs:  A=0 B=0  →  V(INT)~0  →  XOR=0
TEXT 80 480 Left 2 ;══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
TEXT 80 512 Left 3 ;── INPUT A  (0° reference path) ──────────────────────────────
