TEXT 80 576 Left 2 !B_A   VA  0  V=sin(2*pi*10Meg*time)*(((time>1u)&(time<3u))|((time>5u)&(time<7u)))
TEXT 80 608 Left 2 ;
TEXT 80 640 Left 2 !* IDT_A: Low-Q Butterworth-Van Dyke model for fast step response
