TEXT 80 1504 Left 3 ;── INTERFERENCE NODE (INT) ──────────────────────────────────
TEXT 80 1536 Left 2 ;  KCL: V(INT) = superposition of both wave voltages
TEXT 80 1568 Left 2 ;  Constructive (A≠B): full amplitude → logic HIGH
TEXT 80 1600 Left 2 ;  Destructive  (A=B=1): waves cancel → ~0V → logic LOW
TEXT 80 1648 Left 2 ;══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
